---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Our Story — BigBlog"
  description="Learn more about BigBlog, your daily source for science and tech."
>
  <div class="story-container">
    <div class="story-header">
      <h1 class="story-title">Our Story</h1>
      <p class="story-subtitle">Exploring the frontiers of science, technology, and beyond.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="story-content">
      <p>
        At BigBlog, we believe that the best way to understand the rapidly changing world is through
        rigorous, thoughtful, and daily writing. What started as a small side project has grown into
        a vibrant publishing platform dedicated to bringing you the most fascinating insights across
        multiple disciplines.
      </p>

      <p>
        <strong>We post daily blogs about science, tech, and many other topics.</strong> Our mission is
        to bridge the gap between complex discoveries and everyday curiosity. Whether it's the latest
        breakthrough in quantum computing, a deep dive into astrophysics, or the nuances of modern software
        engineering, our writers are committed to clarity and craft.
      </p>

      <div class="story-stats">
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">Daily</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Publications</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat">
          <div class="stat-number">100%</div>
          <div class="stat-label">Editorially Curated</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        Join our growing community of readers and writers. Whether you are here to consume knowledge
        or contribute your own voice, there is a place for you on our canvas.
      </p>

      <div class="story-actions">
        <a href="/write" class="btn btn-primary">Start Writing</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-secondary">Join the Community</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .story-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-xxl) var(--space-md);
    min-height: calc(100vh - 64px);
  }

  .story-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xxl);
  }

  .story-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 5vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--color-ink);
    letter-spacing: -1.5px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }

  .story-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-body-lg);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
  }

  .story-content {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-lg);
  }

  .story-content p {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .story-stats {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-hairline);
    margin: var(--space-md) 0;
  }

  .stat-number {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xs);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
    color: var(--color-muted);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }

  .story-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    margin-top: var(--space-xl);
  }
</style>
